# Catppuccin Mocha Qt palette.
#
# IMPORTANT: this file does NOT theme the Flatpaks in this repository. Flatpak
# redirects XDG_CONFIG_HOME to ~/.var/app/<app-id>/config, and non-KDE Qt
# applications do not read kdeglobals at all; they need a qt5ct/qt6ct color
# scheme plus QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME set through "flatpak override --env".
# See docs/THEMING.md for that recipe. It is left here so that any Qt
# application running outside a sandbox inherits the palette.

